{
  "name": "Eco Nojin — زنجیره علمی از طریق Webhook",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "econojin-chain",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "econojin-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook زنجیره علمی",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-360, 0],
      "webhookId": "econojin-chain"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/motors/chain",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"lat\": {{ $json.body.lat }},\n  \"lon\": {{ $json.body.lon }},\n  \"crop\": \"{{ $json.body.crop || 'wheat' }}\",\n  \"years\": {{ $json.body.years || 20 }},\n  \"slope_pct\": {{ $json.body.slope_pct || 10 }}\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "econojin-chain",
      "name": "اجرای زنجیره RUSLE→RothC→AquaCrop",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-120, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "econojin-respond",
      "name": "پاسخ به فراخوان",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [140, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## زنجیره علمی از طریق n8n\n\n`POST http://<n8n>/webhook/econojin-chain`\n\n```json\n{ \"lat\": 35.7, \"lon\": 51.4, \"crop\": \"wheat\", \"years\": 20, \"slope_pct\": 10 }\n```\n\nخروجی: ZKE، فرسایش RUSLE، کربن RothC و عملکرد AquaCrop — همه با برچسب منبع داده.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "econojin-note2",
      "name": "راهنما",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-360, 200]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook زنجیره علمی": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "اجرای زنجیره RUSLE→RothC→AquaCrop",
